          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771980350827"
          },
          "code": "FORMAT_DOCUMENT_LINES",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771980350827",
          "id": "1771973406432",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771973406433_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Reference for Demand Source Types:\n  | DOCUMENT TYPE | DEMAND SOURCE TYPE    | DEMAND SOURCE TYPE ID |  \n            | ------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- |  \n            | Demand        | Sales order           | 2                     |  \n            | Demand        | Transfer order        | 8                     |  \n            | Demand        | Transfer order return | 18                    |  \n            | Demand        | Work order            | 5                     |  \n            | Demand        | Purchase order        | 1                     |  \n            | Demand        | Account               | 3                     |  \n            | Demand        | Account alias         | 6                     |  \n            | Demand        | Cycle count           | 9                     |  \n            | Demand        | User defined          | 13                    |\n\nGiven the response: {{$context.$nodes.FDD_FETCH_DEMAND_DOCUMENT_LINES_BO.$output.items}}. \nUse the following template for the output of demand source type work order or batch:\n<h3>Demand lines for &lt;DemandSourceType&gt; : &lt;DemandSourceHeaderNumber&gt;</h3>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Operation Sequence Number</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Item Number</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Quantity</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">UOM</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Reservation Status</th>\n      <th colspan=\"3\">Availability</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>On-hand</th>\n      <th>Transfer Orders</th>\n      <th>Work Orders</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n\n  <tbody>\n    <!-- Repeat this <tr> for each line in {{$context.$nodes.FDD_FETCH_DEMAND_DOCUMENT_LINES_BO.$output.items}} -->\n    <tr>\n      <td>{OperationSequenceNumber}</td>\n      <td>{ItemNumber}</td>\n      <td>{RequestedQuantity}</td>\n      <td>{PrimaryUnitOfMeasure}</td>\n      <td>{ReservationStatus}</td>\n      <td>{OnHand}</td>\n      <td>{TransferOrders}</td>\n      <td>{WorkOrders}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h4>Suggested Next Actions</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line using On-hand Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line from Transfer Order Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line from Work Order Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>Cancel.</li>\n</ul>\n\nUse this template for output for everything else:\n<h3>Demand lines for &lt;DemandSourceType&gt; : &lt;DemandSourceHeaderNumber&gt;</h3>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n     <th rowspan=\"2\">Demand Line</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Item Number</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Quantity</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">UOM</th>\n      <th rowspan=\"2\">Reservation Status</th>\n      <th colspan=\"3\">Availability</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>On-hand</th>\n      <th>Transfer Orders</th>\n      <th>Work Orders</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n\n  <tbody>\n    <!-- Repeat this <tr> for each line in {{$context.$nodes.FDD_FETCH_DEMAND_DOCUMENT_LINES_BO.$output.items}} -->\n    <tr>\n      <td>{DemandSourceLineNumber}</td>\n      <td>{ItemNumber}</td>\n      <td>{RequestedQuantity}</td>\n      <td>{PrimaryUnitOfMeasure}</td>\n      <td>{ReservationStatus}</td>\n      <td>{OnHand}</td>\n      <td>{TransferOrders}</td>\n      <td>{WorkOrders}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h4>Suggested Next Actions</h4>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line using On-hand Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line from Transfer Order Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    Reserve a selected line from Work Order Supply\n    <!-- Only show the recommendation text if at least one line qualifies -->\n    <!-- (recommended for line/s: <demand lines>) -->\n  </li>\n  <li>Return to home.</li>\n</ul>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
